    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/13-briarfield-grove-kilbarrack-dublin-d05-ew65\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 13 Briarfield Grove, Kilbarrack.\r\n\r\nNestled within the charming neighbourhood of Kilbarrack, this is a delightful terraced home offering a blend of comfort and convenience. The façade of the property presents a classic style with brickwork, complemented by a neatly maintained front garden that includes a small lawn and a pathway leading to the entrance. Perfectly positioned, this home is just a short stroll from local amenities, including shops and schools, with Kilbarrack DART station less than a 15-minute walk away, providing excellent transport links to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, the ground floor unveils a spacious living room bathed in natural light, with a layout ideal for both relaxing and entertaining. Adjacent to this is a generously sized kitchen/dining area, featuring modern cabinetry and ample workspace suitable for any culinary endeavour. Large, sliding patio doors open to the rear garden, facilitating seamless indoor-outdoor living and allowing for plenty of daylight to flood the interior. The garden itself is a green oasis, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining or a play area, with a handy shed for additional storage.\r\n\r\nThe first floor comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms, offering comfortable living and sleeping arrangements. Each room benefits from large windows, ensuring a bright and airy atmosphere. The family bathroom on this floor is well-appointed and features a classic suite. The property layout promises a practical flow, maximising usable space throughout.\r\n\r\nSituated within a lively community, the property appeals to first-time buyers seeking a starter home in a well-serviced area, or investors looking for a promising rental opportunity. With close proximity to parks and recreational facilities, this home offers a balanced lifestyle for those who appreciate both tranquillity and the vibrancy of urban living."
      },
